#. Settings file problems and :set errors, shown on the settings page; added after the allowed range when 0 also works; {} is what 0 means (e.g. Full width)
msgid " (or 0: {})"
msgstr " (ou 0 : {})"

#. settings value editor for a colour: the format and the theme's own colour; {} is that colour (#rrggbb stays)
msgid "#rrggbb · the theme's {}"
msgstr "#rrggbb · couleur du thème : {}"

#. Teams page, small button after the member chips: adds an agent to the team; keep it short, the + means add
msgid "+ member"
msgstr "+ membre"

#. chat, opened tool output: how many earlier lines are not shown; {n} is the count
msgid "+{n} earlier line"
msgid_plural "+{n} earlier lines"
msgstr[0] "+{n} ligne précédente"
msgstr[1] "+{n} lignes précédentes"

