"Optional shell command run when forgetting a Host's token (uses {url}, {host}, CLARP_SERVER_URL, CLARP_SERVER_HOST)"
msgstr ""
"Commande shell facultative lancée quand le jeton d’un Host est oublié (utilise {url}, {host}, CLARP_SERVER_URL, CLARP_SERVER_HOST)"

