msgctxt "error.ended_from_outside"
msgid "Something outside Clarp ended the turn. Send the message again."
msgstr "Un élément extérieur à Clarp a mis fin au tour. Renvoyez le message."

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the agent's folder is gone); {folder} is a folder path
#. context: error.folder_missing
msgctxt "error.folder_missing"
msgid ""
"This agent's folder {folder} no longer exists. Recreate it, or make a new agent in another folder."
msgstr ""
"Le dossier de cet agent, {folder}, n’existe plus. Recréez-le ou créez un nouvel agent dans un autre dossier."

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the agent's folder is gone)
#. context: error.folder_missing_no_path
msgctxt "error.folder_missing_no_path"
msgid ""
"This agent's folder no longer exists. Recreate it, or make a new agent in another folder."
msgstr ""
"Le dossier de cet agent n’existe plus. Recréez-le ou créez un nouvel agent dans un autre dossier."

