#. context: error.moved
msgctxt "error.moved"
msgid "This agent moved to another Host. Continue the conversation there."
msgstr ""
"Cet agent a été déplacé vers un autre Host. Poursuivez la conversation là-bas."

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the computer had no network for 15 minutes)
#. context: error.network_gone
msgctxt "error.network_gone"
msgid ""
"This computer had no network for 15 minutes, so the turn stopped. Try again once it is online."
msgstr ""
"Cet ordinateur est resté sans réseau pendant 15 minutes, le tour s’est donc arrêté. Réessayez une fois qu’il sera en ligne."

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the Host could not start the turn)
#. context: error.not_started
msgctxt "error.not_started"
msgid "The Host could not start the turn. Try again."
msgstr "Le Host n’a pas pu démarrer le tour. Réessayez."

