#. context: error.provider_busy
msgctxt "error.provider_busy"
msgid ""
"{backend} is overloaded right now, and the Host's retries did not get through. Try again in a minute, or switch model."
msgstr ""
"{backend} est surchargé pour le moment et les nouvelles tentatives du Host ont échoué. Réessayez dans une minute ou changez de modèle."

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the model's provider is unavailable); {model} is a model name, not translated
#. context: error.provider_down
msgctxt "error.provider_down"
